;; expect: reject
;; why: the lambda forces a sequence and is then handed an Int. Catching it needs
;; a closure to have a domain, which the tag lattice cannot give it: with
;; `carp-ct-types` as the backend this case is missed, and with the arrows of
;; `carp-ct-sub` it is caught. It was the first `gap` in this corpus to close.
(defndynamic apply-to-three [] (let [head (fn [xs] (car xs))] (head 3)))
